OL,3,GNEWSARare 'fragile' recordings saved
OL,4,Abefore they disappear
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of recordings capturing the
OL,7,Fvoices, accents and memories of people
OL,8,Facross the South West are being rescued
OL,9,Fbefore fragile tapes deteriorate beyond
OL,10,Frepair.
OL,12,FArchivists say some are at risk of
OL,13,Fbeing lost forever as ageing cassette
OL,14,Fand reel-to-reel tapes begin to break
OL,15,Fdown.
OL,17,FThe Sounds of the South West project is
OL,18,Fdigitising them, preserving everything
OL,19,Ffrom Cornish dialect and sea shanties
OL,20,Fto memories of salmon fishing on the
OL,21,FRiver Severn.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,344,340,200,160,0,100
