OL,3,GNEWSARare 'fragile' recordings saved
OL,4,Abefore they disappear
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It's a living history and it's a
OL,7,Fglimpse into the past, which you often
OL,8,Fdon't find so easy to get from a book,"
OL,9,Fsaid Philip Walker, head of culture and
OL,10,Fcreative industries at Bristol City
OL,11,FCouncil.
